UPDATE ANGULAR CLI VERSION
  node version used -> 20.19.5
  npm uninstall -g @angular/cli
  npm install -g @angular/cli@19.2.15

# DEPENDENCIES

## Production dependencies (required for the app to run)
 npm install primeng@19.1.4 @primeuix/themes      ## Primeng 19.1.4 for components
 npm install primeicons                           ## Prime Icons
 npm install date-fns                             ## Library for date and time
 npm install jwt-decode                           ## Library for JWT decoding
 npm install @ngx-translate/core                  ## Library for internationalization (i18n)
 npm install @ngx-translate/http-loader           ## Library for translation http loader (i18n)

## Development dependencies. Use --save-dev (or -D) for packages not needed in the final production bundle.
 npm install --save-dev tailwindcss
 npm install --save-dev @tailwindcss/postcss
 npm install --save-dev postcss
 npm install --save-dev tailwindcss-primeui
 npm install --save-dev npm init @eslint/config@latest


#CONFIGURATION
 -> Tailwindcss CSS
    - Create tailwind.css on /src/ folder
    - Import tailwind.css on styles.css
    - Create .postcssrc.js on root folder

 -> Application
    - Import BrowserAnimationsModule on AppModule
    - Create CustomColors constant on AppModule with theme colors using Primeng theme as base
